OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated after flat
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are at the scene of a fire
OL,7,Fthat started in a building containing
OL,8,Fflats in Liskeard.
OL,10,FCrews from Liskeard, Bodmin,
OL,11,FLostwithiel, and Looe used breathing
OL,12,Fapparatus and hose reel jets on the
OL,13,Ffire after a call out at 18:38 BST on
OL,14,FWednesday, Cornwall Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService said.
OL,17,FResident Andy Field said firefighters
OL,18,Fhave had to remove roofing tiles as
OL,19,Fpart of the operation.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
