OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated after flat
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the flats on Catchfrench
OL,7,FCrescent were home to young families
OL,8,Fand single people and added: "We have
OL,9,Fall been evacuated 20 to 30-metres from
OL,10,Fthe damage."
